      "content": "\"Letting go\" doesn't have to mean a dramatic surrender; it can mean finding a way to ease the tension of the fight itself. If the design is fixed, then the only variable is how you experience the journey until that point. Sometimes, accepting the inevitable means finding a quiet, contained way to let the pressure out, rather than letting it build until it bursts.",
